i7"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.record-257hg-i7"],"id":"long.record-257hg-i7","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 6.116 (Three possibilities at a skipped endpoint)","locator":"Long record Theorem 6.116, p. 76, label record:257hg-i7","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*For a rank $s\\ge5$ omitted by the real greedy support, let $H_s$ and $f_s$ be as in Lemma 6.45. That lemma identifies the actual prefix as $D_s$ when $f_s\\le0$ and as $B_s$ when $f_s>0$, with the exact remainder or overshoot in each case. To obtain the nonnegative-margin condition in Definition 6.81, the negative case would still have to be excluded at every required skipped rank. The trichotomy itself does not exclude it. In particular, the value $-3$ excluded for $C_D$ under the all-right-tail hypothesis of Theorem 6.44 is not an exclusion for $f_s$: the coordinates and the hypotheses are different.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257hg-i7","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257hg-i7","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257hg-i7%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.halfGreedy_skipped_endpoint_trichotomy%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257hg-i7%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.halfGreedy_skipped_endpoint_trichotomy%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.halfGreedy_skipped_endpoint_trichotomy"},{"derived":true,"family":"provenance","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257hg-i7","id":"field:006486e007068994a8a73a2606a356e18